---
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section
    id="experience"
    data-theme="dark"
    class="relative flex flex-col gap-4 overflow-hidden bg-dark-surface px-4 pb-6 pt-16 sm:gap-6 lg:pt-0"
>
    <!-- Layer 0: technical grid (hairlines on dark) -->
    <div
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0 flex justify-center px-4"
    >
        <div
            class="grid h-full w-full max-w-screen-lg grid-cols-2 border-x border-on-dark lg:grid-cols-4"
        >
            <span class="border-r border-on-dark"></span>
            <span class="hidden border-r border-on-dark lg:block"></span>
            <span class="hidden border-r border-on-dark lg:block"></span>
            <span class="hidden lg:block"></span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Layer 0: typography as background (single word, bleed) -->
    <div
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0 select-none"
    >
        <p
            class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 w-max -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-center font-primary text-[clamp(4rem,15vw,13rem)] font-bold uppercase leading-[0.9] tracking-wide text-on-dark opacity-[0.08]"
        >
            Experience
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- HUD: top corners -->
    <div
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="relative z-20 mx-auto flex w-full max-w-screen-lg items-center justify-between font-mono text-[0.625rem] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-on-dark-secondary"
        data-reveal
    >
        <span>02 / Experience</span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-on-dark"></span>
            Timeline
        </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline (owns the slide center) -->
    <div
        class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex w-full max-w-screen-lg flex-1 flex-col justify-center pt-8 lg:pt-0"
    >
        <div>
            <SectionHeading index="02" title="Experience" tone="dark" />
            <ol class="relative border-s border-on-dark">
                <!-- data-reveal lives on an inner wrapper: a transforming li
                     would become the containing block of the absolutely
                     positioned rail node and displace it during the reveal. -->
                <li class="mb-10 ms-6">
                    <span
                        class="absolute -start-1 mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-on-dark ring-4 ring-dark-surface"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                    >
                    </span>
                    <div data-reveal>
                        <span
                            class="mb-1 block font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-on-dark-secondary"
                        >
                            Frontend Developer Intern
                        </span>
                        <h3
                            class="flex items-center mb-1 text-lg font-semibold text-on-dark"
                        >
                            Centauro Solutions
                        </h3>
                        <time
                            class="block mb-2 text-base font-normal leading-none text-on-dark-secondary"
                            >(3 months) September 2025 – November 2025
                        </time>
                        <p
                            class="mb-4 text-base font-normal text-on-dark-secondary"
                        >
                            At Centauro Solutions, I worked as a Frontend Developer Intern. My
                            main task was to improve the platform’s responsive
                            design to provide a better UX/UI for clients. I also
                            worked with the SCRUM methodology and used Git Flow for
                            version control, including releases, hotfixes, and code
                            reviews.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="mb-10 ms-6">
                    <span
                        class="absolute -start-1 mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-on-dark ring-4 ring-dark-surface"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                    >
                    </span>
                    <div data-reveal>
                        <span
                            class="mb-1 block font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-on-dark-secondary"
                        >
                            Full Stack Developer
                        </span>
                        <h3
                            class="flex items-center mb-1 text-lg font-semibold text-on-dark"
                        >
                            Universidad de Costa Rica's Research and Development
                            (R&D) team
                        </h3>
                        <time
                            class="block mb-2 text-base font-normal leading-none text-on-dark-secondary"
                            >1+ year (ongoing)</time
                        >
                        <p
                            class="mb-4 text-base font-normal text-on-dark-secondary"
                        >
                            In the R&D team, I work as a Full Stack Developer using technologies such as Laravel and React. We also use the SCRUM methodology, manage version control with GitHub, and work with Docker containers. We develop functional projects for the University of Costa Rica (UCR). Additionally, I work with CMS platforms like WordPress to manage the UCR website.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HUD: bottom corners -->
    <div
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="relative z-20 mx-auto flex w-full max-w-screen-lg items-center justify-between font-mono text-[0.625rem] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-on-dark-secondary"
        data-reveal
    >
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2">Scroll <span>↓</span></span>
        <span>K. Guido</span>
    </div>
</section>
